// Direct CX/CZ convention:
//   syn  : |+> preparation, X-basis measurement
//   X component: CX(syn -> data)
//   Z component: CZ(syn, data)
//   flag : |0> preparation, Z-basis measurement
//   flag coupling: CX(syn -> flag)

